      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "By default this is initialized via\n<a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getDefaultDetailMessageCode(java.lang.Class,java.lang.String)\"><code>ErrorResponse.getDefaultDetailMessageCode(Class, String)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，这通过 <a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getDefaultDetailMessageCode(java.lang.Class,java.lang.String)\"><code>ErrorResponse.getDefaultDetailMessageCode(Class, String)</code></a> 初始化。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Extends <code>ServletException</code> for convenient throwing in any Servlet\nresource (such as a Filter).",
      "translation": "扩展<code>ServletException</code>，以便在任意 Servlet 资源（例如 Filter）中方便地抛出异常。",
      "count": 2
