    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\">getDetailMessageCode</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web\">ErrorResponse</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\">getDetailMessageCode</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web\">ErrorResponse</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>messageDetailArguments</code> - the arguments to make available when\nresolving the problem \"detail\" through a <code>MessageSource</code>",
      "translation": "<code>messageDetailArguments</code> - 在通过 <code>MessageSource</code> 解析“detail\"问题时可用的参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>cause</code> - the root cause",
      "translation": "<code>cause</code> - 根本原因",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> The returned <code>ProblemDetail</code> may be\nupdated before the response is rendered, for example, via\n<a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#updateAndGetBody(org.springframework.context.MessageSource,java.util.Locale)\"><code>ErrorResponse.updateAndGetBody(MessageSource, Locale)</code></a>. Therefore, implementing\nmethods should use an instance field, and should not re-create the\n<code>ProblemDetail</code> on every call, nor use a static variable.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 返回的 <code>ProblemDetail</code> 可能在响应渲染之前被更新，例如通过<a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#updateAndGetBody(org.springframework.context.MessageSource,java.util.Locale)\"><code>ErrorResponse.updateAndGetBody(MessageSource, Locale)</code></a>。因此，实现方法应使用实例字段，不应在每次调用时重新创建 <code>ProblemDetail</code>，也不应使用静态变量。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the body for the response, formatted as an RFC 9457\n<a href=\"../../http/ProblemDetail.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ProblemDetail</code></a> whose <a href=\"../../http/ProblemDetail.html#getStatus()\"><code>status</code></a>\nshould match the response status.",
      "translation": "返回响应体的 RFC 9457 格式，其 `<a href=\"../../http/ProblemDetail.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ProblemDetail</code></a>` 的 `<a href=\"../../http/ProblemDetail.html#getStatus()\"><code>status</code></a>` 应与响应状态匹配。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return arguments to use along with a <a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a> to resolve the problem \"detail\" for this exception\nthrough a <a href=\"../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回要与<a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a>一起使用的参数，以便通过一个<a href=\"../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>解析此异常的“detail”问题。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return arguments to use along with a <a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a> to resolve the problem \"detail\" for this exception\nthrough a <a href=\"../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>. The arguments are expanded\ninto placeholders of the message value, for example, \"Invalid content type {0}\".",
      "translation": "返回要与<a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a>一起使用的参数，以便通过一个<a href=\"../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>解析此异常的“detail”。这些参数被扩展为消息值的占位符，例如，“Invalid content type {0}\"。",
      "count": 1
    },
